{"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Audit-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator"],"title":"Audit Types"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"title":"Data Lineage & Transformation Audit Trails","modules":[{"name":"SwiftAgent"}],"role":"collectionGroup","roleHeading":"API Collection"},"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/DataLineageAudit"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Track and inspect the complete lifecycle and data flow of tabular transformations in autonomous agents."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When autonomous LLM agents manipulate datasets via DSL commands or tool execution, compliance and debugging require a complete record of every transformation."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftAgentEvaluator"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically generates an immutable audit trail of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" entries for each command evaluated."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"LineageRecord Structure","anchor":"LineageRecord-Structure"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord"},{"type":"text","text":" contains:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stepIndex"},{"text":": Sequential index of the step within the agent trajectory.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"operation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The normalized DSL command executed (e.g., ","type":"text"},{"code":"filter(age)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"groupBy(category,mean)"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"inputRows","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Dataset row count immediately prior to transformation.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"outputRows","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": Dataset row count produced by the transformation."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"timestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The exact timestamp of execution.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example: Accessing Audit Trails","anchor":"Example-Accessing-Audit-Trails"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftAgent","import SwiftDataFrame","","let evaluator = SwiftAgentEvaluator()","let filteredDF = try await evaluator.evaluate(command: \"filter age > 25\", on: rawDF)","let aggregatedDF = try await evaluator.evaluate(command: \"groupby department mean\", on: filteredDF)","","let auditTrail = await evaluator.lineage","for record in auditTrail {","    print(\"Step \\(record.stepIndex): \\(record.operation) [\\(record.inputRows) -> \\(record.outputRows) rows] at \\(record.timestamp)\")","}","","\/\/ Reset audit trail when starting a fresh session:","await evaluator.clearLineage()"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftagent\/datalineageaudit"]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/SwiftAgentEvaluator":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SwiftAgentEvaluator"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Agentic Swift Execution Sandbox Evaluator."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"a